# Loan Application Credit Scoring System

## Problem Statement

Loan Application Credit Scoring Sheet

### Domain
Lending / Credit Risk

## Use Cases

- Score applicants based on income, obligations, and bureau history using a rule table.
- Output an Approve / Refer / Decline decision with reasons.

## Bottlenecks Students May Encounter

- Missing bureau history must not default to a zero score.
- FOIR calculation must include EMIs of co-applicants.
